cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use metafspm, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "metafspm: a framework for coupling functional-structural plant models"
abstract: >-
  metafspm is an OpenAlea framework for functional-structural plant models (FSPM). Each process is a component
  that declares its variables (units, locations on a multiscale plant graph, kinds), its parameters and its
  equations; components make plant models, and plant models and environment models (soil, light) make a scene that
  plants a stand, links the models' variables with unit checks and steps them in time. The scene schedules and
  solves the coupled processes (graph systems, linear and nonlinear solvers, kernels), records tables, checkpoints
  and encoding3d frames of the whole scene. Ported models include root and shoot architectures (ArchiSimple, Adel),
  root anatomies (GRANAP), root hydraulics (MECHA), light (Caribu) and gas exchange (CNW-Grass).
